As the Sarpanch of Kothali, Dist-Jalgaon (Maharashtra) took initiative in providing clean and pure water to the villagers; solved the problems of drainage and concretization of the village roads; took initiative in providing street lights of every corner of the village; started a pilot project of Public Lavatory for women, which eradicated the dirt from the public streets; and started a pilot project of providing education in Semi-English medium at the Z.P. School Kothali, Distt. Jalgaon ;
 As the Chairperson of Education, Health and Sports Committee Jalgaon Zillah Parishad, Dist-Jalgaon (Maharashtra) Successfully started and spread the pilot project of providing education in Semi-English medium in Z.P. Schools at district level; Took initiative in providing pure and hygienic care facilities for pregnant women in the Rural Health Centers of the district; Opening of five New Rural Health Centers in the district; Took active steps towards the modernization and quality education in Z.P. Schools; took active steps in providing insurance support for students in the district schools; took initiative in providing e-Learning facilities in the Zillah Parishad Schools; and Solved the problems of water supply in the remote villages like Garbardi, Tal: Raver, Distt. Jalgaon 
 President, Gurunath Foundation, Muktainagar, Distt. Jalgaon, Maharashtra; Secretary, Muktainagar Shikshan Prasarak Mandal, Muktainagar; Vice President, Muktai Sanskritik Kala Manch; and Director, Adishakti Mahila Credit Society, Muktainagar
